      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive vets and supportive technicians"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners on East Bell Road consistently praise Dr. Calugcugan (Dr. Cal), Dr. Rian, and technicians Jennifer, Rain, Kayla, and Jake for their empathy and thorough care. Clients highlight warm front-desk service during both routine check-ups and stressful urgent visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Calm handling for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently note how well the team handles nervous herding dogs, senior cats, and vocal pit bull mixes without needing unnecessary sedation. Owners say their pets relax quickly in the examination rooms and receive gentle post-operative support."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective urgent care and surgeries"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report successful outcomes for emergency splenic haematoma surgeries, wound stapling, dental extractions, and laser therapy recovery plans. One dog owner, however, questioned a pneumonia diagnosis after their young dog passed away following treatment."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does ArkVets North Phoenix offer evening and weekend appointments?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the clinic is open from 10:00 to 20:00 Monday through Friday and 08:00 to 18:00 on Saturdays, which reviewers find convenient for urgent and after-work visits."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can the clinic handle urgent pet injuries and emergency surgery?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers report fast urgent care for leg lacerations, acute illnesses, and emergency surgeries such as splenic haematoma removal."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How do clients describe pricing and payment options at ArkVets?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Several owners appreciate transparent upfront estimates and a monthly membership plan that discounts care, though one reviewer found euthanasia and cremation fees expensive."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    }
